+# Layout A (corp mk2-space, TRUTH D37). One layout for both MK2 builds: `make DEVICE=mk2
+# samplefocus` (0000 lean + 0001) uses the 0000/0001 claims and leaves 0008's free;
+# `samplefocus-cut` adds 0008's.
