+# ------------------------------------------------------- 0000-shared
+
+# MK2 has no full 0000-shared: both MK2 builds pass lean = 1 (the Makefile). The claim
+# is ungated, so a build with lean = 0 is refused by its size (the full runtime is
+# 236 B), not silently dropped.
