Subject: [PATCH 35/44] D39 press_gate: pressing a CHOP or SMP CUT knob with
 trigs held no longer writes hidden p-locks (MK1 + MK2)

Stock's knob-PRESS lock path (page-view slot 0x80: MK1 0x400384f8, MK2 0x400387ba)
was ungated. With trigs held it locked the knob's shown value on each held step, and
for CHOP's ids (and 0008's 1..2 in image B) that lock landed in lock slot 0, the
sound's free word that SMP CUT reads as LCT/HCT (MK2 gate opus G1).

press_gate is a detour at the routine's entry (displaced 4fefffd048d71c3c on both
