off, inside a chord, or on stock's kind-2 path), RAM-only state, limits (4
notes, poly requirement, HOLD, shared key ids, overlap ownership, popup, menus,
MIDI in), the live-REC merge caveat (keys-sk-notes plan problem 3), why
FUNCTION + OCTAVE UP (keys-gesture + skeptic), hooks and register discipline,
