on the built image (corp keys-builder step2_hostcheck/pathcheck/regcheck), the
test card K0 (control first) .. K14, the recovery route (FUNCTION at power-on,
TRIG 4, DIN, stock 1.56 cda4459d...), open decisions and hardware unknowns.
No build input changed.

