+0x4023485c +668); both detours jump to their resolved entries; the displaced bytes are
+re-emitted in the stub; both rejoins correct; PASS.
+
+### Proof on the built image (host, read-only: objdump / nm / python; corp keys-builder)
+
+- `step2_hostcheck.txt`: the build's stock_mainos.bin is the RE lanes' raw section; 603
