+  code; the rest of the pool is zero; the state bytes are zero (power-on: off); the popup
+  format table points at `CHORD ON: 0 %d` / `... %d %d` / `... %d %d %d` (each expands to at
+  most 20 of the popup's 32 characters).
+- `step2_pathcheck.out` (scripts/pathcheck.py over `step2_chord_elf.dis`): every path of
+  `chord_on`, `chord_key_gate`, `chord_capture` and `cap_counts` walked (191 of 194
+  instructions reached; the other 3 are `chord_stock` itself, entered as stock's entry);
