+### If it does not boot, or to go back to stock
+
+- **Recovery route** (manual, EARLY STARTUP MENU): hold `[FUNCTION]` while powering on;
+  `[TRIG 4]` = OS UPGRADE; connect the Analog Keys **MIDI IN** (DIN) to the computer's MIDI
